<v><b>A:</b></v> I like Anna.

00:00:11.186 --> 00:00:12.186
I like her.

00:00:14.435 --> 00:00:15.027
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:17.519
<v><b>B:</b></v> I know your husband.

00:00:22.401 --> 00:00:23.326
I know him.

00:00:25.659 --> 00:00:26.274
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.291
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can you help Jane and me?

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.266
Can you help us?

00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:38.285
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:38.944 --> 00:00:41.433
<v><b>B:</b></v> I want to speak to David and Sally.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:47.946
I want to speak to them.

00:00:50.129 --> 00:00:50.866
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:51.763 --> 00:00:53.267
<v><b>A:</b></v> I love this song.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.250
I love it.

00:01:01.675 --> 00:01:02.448
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.889
<v><b>B:</b></v> I live near Catherine and Richard.

00:01:10.815 --> 00:01:12.014
I live near them.

00:01:14.539 --> 00:01:15.315
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:16.748 --> 00:01:18.574
<v><b>A:</b></v> Wait for my brother and me!

00:01:23.415 --> 00:01:24.489
