00:01:27.405 --> 00:01:28.031
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:29.231 --> 00:01:31.172
<v><b>B:</b></v> I don’t like these shoes.

00:01:36.072 --> 00:01:37.330
I don’t like them.

00:01:39.622 --> 00:01:40.410
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:41.693 --> 00:01:43.322
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you work with Suzanna?

00:01:48.393 --> 00:01:49.551
