00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:52.584
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:53.527 --> 00:01:55.348
<v><b>B:</b></v> I see Jack every day.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:01.960
I see him every day.